        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin SEA-CSR, Seattle Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe love the strong, sharp silhouette of the Seattle Handleset. It is a modern piece for front doors of even the most contemporary homes. The Seattle Grade 2 Entrance Set is available in Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, and Venetian Bronze finishes. Choose from 3 modern interior trim options like the Tube Lever that is pictured. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Seattle Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, and dummy functions. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Seattle Handleset with Contemporary Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Modern Seattle Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 17-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Length: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Seattle Handleset with Square Rosette",
                "description": "Baldwin SEA-CSR, Seattle Handleset - We love the strong, sharp silhouette of the Seattle Handleset. It is a modern piece for front doors of even the most contemporary homes. The Seattle Grade 2 Entrance Set is available in Satin Nickel, Polished Chrome, and Venetian Bronze finishes. Choose from 3 modern interior trim. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, the Seattle Entryset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, and dummy functions. This handleset comes with an adjustable latch that will fit 2-3/4 inch backsets and 2-3/8 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch up to 2-1/2 inch thick doors.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Contemporary entry sets, Contemporary handlesets, Modern front door entry sets, Modern entry sets, Modern handlesets, Modern front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Seattle Handleset with Square Rosettes, BAL-xxSEASQUCSR, Baldwin Seattle Entryset with Square Roses, Baldwin SEA-CSR, BAL-SEA-CSR, Seattle Handleset with Contemporary Square Roses, Seattle Handlesets, Baldwin Reserve Modern Seattle Entrance Sets,"
